# Lockfile rules (EAS Build uses npm 10.9.2, see packageManager in package.json):
# - Adding/upgrading a dependency drops other platforms' native binaries from
#   package-lock.json (npm 10 behaviour). Afterwards run: npm run check:lockfile
#   and, if it fails: npm run lock:regen
# - Before pushing dependency changes, npm run check:linux reproduces the EAS
#   Linux install in Docker.
